cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "omni-verify: Enforcement-Capability Projection for Multi-Platform Content Integrity Scoring"
abstract: >-
  A multi-platform content integrity engine. Computes a Compromised Content
  Ratio (CCR) over merged spans of flagged content, assigns a tiered
  enforcement level against an explicit 20 percent threshold, and projects
  the resulting verdict onto each platform's actual enforcement capability,
  declaring explicitly which requested actions a platform cannot perform.
type: software
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-18"
keywords:
  - misinformation detection
  - content integrity
  - fact-checking
  - content moderation
  - computational propaganda